      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's really helpful. i also want to talk about how they took on the big corporations. it seems like the main issue was just corporate greed and companies trying to bypass democratic norms to keep profits high. can u give me some specific examples of where union activism directly stopped corporate overreach and protected the public interest?",
