      "content": "thanks. i'm also looking at the other side of it for my essay, just to show i've done my research. some people argue that unions actually hurt the economy or made things less efficient by being too powerful. do u think those criticisms are valid? or are they just excuses used by corporations to avoid giving people what they deserve?",
